SUMMARY:Music Bingo
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a fun twist on bingo! Join us in the Highland Taproom every Tuesday from 6–8 PM for Music Bingo with Spencer. It’s free to play\, so bring your friends\, grab a drink\, and test your music knowledge while enjoying great vibes. \n\nEach round features your favorite tunes—match the songs to your bingo card and win awesome prizes! Plus\, enjoy delicious eats from rotating food trucks on-site. \n✅ Free to play\n✅ Prizes for winners\n✅ Food trucks & craft beer \nKick back\, sing along\, and make Tuesday nights your new favorite tradition at Highland!
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/music-bingo/2026-09-29/
