SUMMARY:The Wilson Springs Hotel
DESCRIPTION:Bio:\nHomegrown in the rich music scene of Virginia\, The Wilson Springs Hotel is a 5-star quintet brought together within a union of genres – a high-energy folk act committed to rock & roll\, bluegrass and classic country. \nTheir new record “The Day the Bloodroot Bloomed” released on March 20\, 2026. The album is an explanation of aging and how you start to lose more people in your life from all kinds of circumstances. How aging is a beautiful thing and leading towards the inevitable at the same time. Overall the record is a description of the beauty and darkness that comes with being alive. \nForming in 2021\, the band released two albums in quick succession\, while growing a steadfast audience from their fiery and memorable performances out on the road. The group is named after a historic hotel in Lexington\, Virginia\, home of lead vocalist/songwriter/guitarist Jacob Ritter. They expertly package dynamic performances full of raw emotion\, humor and storytelling\, with song-by-song showcases of each player’s talents. You will undoubtedly enjoy the many lovely amenities offered to you during your stay with The Wilson Springs Hotel. \n 
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/the-wilson-springs-hotel/
